# Owner-only licensed assets (v2.1): Neue Montreal (Pangram Pangram) and Basil Icons (Craftwork)
# from the user's own copies, served by the API to the owner only. Never commit or redistribute.
frontend/private/*
!frontend/private/README.md
frontend/public/fonts/
frontend/src/components/icons/basil.generated.ts
# iOS app (mobile/): the user's own licensed font and icon files. Never committed (public repo);
# CI gets them from an encrypted GitHub secret. Only the README in this folder is tracked.
mobile/assets/private/*
!mobile/assets/private/README.md
# iOS CI: the private assets packed into secret-sized chunks (npm run pack-secrets). Never commit.
mobile/.ci-secrets/
